%% Catalog from code — Developer Hub & Golden Paths, lab exercise 1 ("What just happened").
%% Each service repo carries a catalog-info.yaml; the portal reads it (over Gitea's in-cluster
%% address) into one catalog entity, and that one entity is what both the portal page the attendee
%% clicked and the catalog REST API the terminal queried return.
%% Shape (diagram-size-guard): LR, longest chain 3 nodes, no subgraph, labels at most 2 lines.
flowchart LR
  FILE[/"catalog-info.yaml<br/>in the service repo"/] -->|"read by the portal"| ENT["catalog entity<br/>owner, System, API"]
  ENT --> UI["portal page<br/>what you clicked"]
  ENT --> API["catalog API<br/>what curl asked"]
  classDef hi fill:#e00,stroke:#900,color:#fff;
  classDef plat fill:#f3f3f3,stroke:#888,color:#333;
  classDef done fill:#e6f4ea,stroke:#137333,color:#0d652d;
  class ENT hi;
  class FILE plat;
  class UI,API done;
